flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Read edited values]
    B --> C[Create ValidationService]
    C --> D{User ID valid?}
    D -- No --> E[Show invalid user ID]
    D -- Yes --> F{User exists?}
    F -- No --> G[Show missing user]
    F -- Yes --> H{All editable fields empty?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Show no data updated]
    H -- No --> J{Any editable field empty?}
    J -- Yes --> K[Show fill all fields]
    J -- No --> L{First name valid?}
    L -- No --> M[Show invalid first name]
    L -- Yes --> N{Last name valid?}
    N -- No --> O[Show invalid last name]
    N -- Yes --> P{Email valid?}
    P -- No --> Q[Show invalid email]
    P -- Yes --> R[Call Admin.editClientData]
    R --> S{Updated?}
    S -- Yes --> T[Show success]
    S -- No --> U[Show failure]
    E --> V[End]
    G --> V
    I --> V
    K --> V
    M --> V
    O --> V
    Q --> V
    T --> V
    U --> V
